d at any cost we're  going to prevail even though it's early  in the war and i think that ukrainians  want to be  the nation that people are proud to  identify with you know like mila kunis  all of a sudden decided that she's a  ukrainian because it's cool to be  ukrainian so i think ukrainians want to  be perceived as cool contemporary  and freedom loving  hola flamenco  joining us tonight from kiev although we  appreciate you taking the time at such a  dangerous time to share your story with  us we wish you and your father all the  best and we hope  that  very soon you'll be able to turn the  lights back on thank you  thank you so much thank you for having  me  you
 

